&lt;p&gt;From: Gema Allen, To: Ruby Chandler&lt;br&gt;
Mailed From: Roadhouse, Illinois on December 27, 1910&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Miss Ruby Chandler&lt;br&gt;
Pearl, Illinois&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;How is Pearl by this time? Ans. soon.&lt;br&gt;
Gema Allen&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Stamped at the bottom:&lt;br&gt;
Porter &amp;amp; Allen&lt;br&gt;
Dry Goods &amp;amp; Clothing&lt;br&gt;
Roadhouse, Illinois&lt;/p&gt;</description>
